- @co_leader_1_no_challenge: [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] faces no challenge.

@co_leader_1_challenge
choose-if: (spd_coleader_1_faction != conference_majority) and (spd_coleader_1_faction != plurality_winner)
unavailable-subtitle: The other factions lack the momentum to force through a challenge.

[+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] has come under challenge at the Conference! They will attempt to survive the challenge, but their victory is far from guaranteed. Who wins the vote?

- @incumbent_1: The incumbent, [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], wins in a victory for the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction!
- @left_1: [+ left_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Left faction!
- @center_1: [+ center_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Center faction!
- @labor_1: [+ labor_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Labor faction!
- @reformist_1: [+ reformist_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Reformist faction!
- @neorevisionist_1: [+ neorevisionist_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Neorevisionist faction!

@incumbent_1
view-if: spd_coleader_1 != "Vacant"
choose-if: (spd_coleader_1_faction != "Left" and ((left_votes + labor_votes) >= 50)) or (spd_coleader_1_faction != "Center" and ((center_votes+left_votes) < 50 and (center_votes+labor_votes) < 50 and (center_votes+reformist_votes + neorevisionist_votes) < 50)) or (spd_coleader_1_faction != "Labor" and ((labor_votes + left_votes) >= 50 or (labor_votes + reformist_votes + neorevisionist_votes) >= 50 or (labor_votes + center_votes) >= 50)) or (spd_coleader_1_faction == "Reformist" and ((labor_votes+reformist_votes+neorevisionist_votes) >= 50 or (center_votes+reformist_votes + neorevisionist_votes) < 50)) or (spd_coleader_1_faction == "Neorevisionist" and (labor_votes+reformist_votes+neorevisionist_votes) >= 50) or (spd_coleader_1_faction == "Nonfactional" and left_votes < 50 and center_votes < 50 and labor_votes < 50 and (reformist_votes + neorevisionist_votes) < 50)
unavailable-subtitle: The incumbent does not have enough votes.

The incumbent, [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], wins in a victory for the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction!

